    "['ppp mp [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 1 family ppp multilink-bundle mp-3/0/1', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Juniper equivalent command for `ppp mp Mp-group3/0/1`:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 1 family ppp multilink-bundle mp-3/0/1\\nset interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 2 family ppp multilink-bundle mp-3/0/1\\n##\\n\\nNote: \\n1. Juniper uses `multilink-bundle` instead of Huawei's `ppp mp` for PPP multilink configuration.\\n2. The interface naming convention is different - Juniper uses `se-` prefix for serial interfaces and separates unit numbers with `/`.\\n3. Both serial interfaces (unit 1 and unit 2) need to be configured separately to join the multilink bundle.\\n4. The multilink interface name `mp-3/0/1` maintains the same logical numbering as Huawei's `Mp-group3/0/1`.\", 'trans_template': 'set interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 1 family ppp multilink-bundle mp-3/0/1'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 2 family ppp multilink-bundle mp-3/0/1', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Juniper equivalent command for `ppp mp Mp-group3/0/1`:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 1 family ppp multilink-bundle mp-3/0/1\\nset interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 2 family ppp multilink-bundle mp-3/0/1\\n##\\n\\nNote: \\n1. Juniper uses `multilink-bundle` instead of Huawei's `ppp mp` for PPP multilink configuration.\\n2. The interface naming convention is different - Juniper uses `se-` prefix for serial interfaces and separates unit numbers with `/`.\\n3. Both serial interfaces (unit 1 and unit 2) need to be configured separately to join the multilink bundle.\\n4. The multilink interface name `mp-3/0/1` maintains the same logical numbering as Huawei's `Mp-group3/0/1`.\", 'trans_template': 'set interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 2 family ppp multilink-bundle mp-3/0/1'}]]": 1,
    "['link-protocol [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces serial-3/0/0/1:1 encapsulation ppp', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nset interfaces serial-3/0/0/1:1 encapsulation ppp\\nset interfaces serial-3/0/0/2:1 encapsulation ppp\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- In Juniper, the equivalent of Huawei's `link-protocol ppp` is `encapsulation ppp` under the interface configuration.\\n- The command structure follows Juniper's format: `set interfaces <interface-name> encapsulation ppp`.\\n- Both serial interfaces (1:1 and 2:1) are configured similarly in Juniper as they were in Huawei.\\n- The interface naming convention is adjusted to match Juniper's style (serial-3/0/0/1:1 instead of Serial3/0/0/1:1).\", 'trans_template': 'set interfaces serial-3/0/0/1:1 encapsulation ppp'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces serial-3/0/0/2:1 encapsulation ppp', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nset interfaces serial-3/0/0/1:1 encapsulation ppp\\nset interfaces serial-3/0/0/2:1 encapsulation ppp\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- In Juniper, the equivalent of Huawei's `link-protocol ppp` is `encapsulation ppp` under the interface configuration.\\n- The command structure follows Juniper's format: `set interfaces <interface-name> encapsulation ppp`.\\n- Both serial interfaces (1:1 and 2:1) are configured similarly in Juniper as they were in Huawei.\\n- The interface naming convention is adjusted to match Juniper's style (serial-3/0/0/1:1 instead of Serial3/0/0/1:1).\", 'trans_template': 'set interfaces serial-3/0/0/2:1 encapsulation ppp'}]]": 1,
    "['ppp mp [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 1 family inet multilink-master mp-group3/0/1', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the Juniper equivalent of the HUAWEI `ppp mp Mp-group3/0/1` command:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 1 family inet multilink-master mp-group3/0/1\\nset interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 2 family inet multilink-master mp-group3/0/1\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Juniper:\\n1. The multilink PPP (MP) interface is configured under the family inet hierarchy\\n2. The physical interfaces are assigned to the multilink bundle using the `multilink-master` statement\\n3. Juniper uses a different interface naming convention (se-3/0/0 instead of Serial3/0/0)\", 'trans_template': 'set interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 1 family inet multilink-master mp-group3/0/1'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 2 family inet multilink-master mp-group3/0/1', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the Juniper equivalent of the HUAWEI `ppp mp Mp-group3/0/1` command:\\n\\n##\\nset interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 1 family inet multilink-master mp-group3/0/1\\nset interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 2 family inet multilink-master mp-group3/0/1\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Juniper:\\n1. The multilink PPP (MP) interface is configured under the family inet hierarchy\\n2. The physical interfaces are assigned to the multilink bundle using the `multilink-master` statement\\n3. Juniper uses a different interface naming convention (se-3/0/0 instead of Serial3/0/0)\", 'trans_template': 'set interfaces se-3/0/0 unit 2 family inet multilink-master mp-group3/0/1'}]]": 1,
